  "html": "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">---------- Forwarded message ---------<br>From: <strong class=\"gmail_sendername\" dir=\"auto\">Jeff Solomon</strong> <span dir=\"auto\">&lt;<a href=\"mailto:jeff@markuphero.com\">jeff@markuphero.com</a>&gt;</span><br>Date: Thu, Jul 21, 2022 at 10:32 PM<br>Subject: Crop, it&#39;s so useful 🧐<br>To:  &lt;<a href=\"mailto:matt@hellodeco.so\">matt@hellodeco.so</a>&gt;<br></div><br><br><div><div align=\"center\" style=\"color:#727272;font-size:10px\">If you are not able to see this mail, click <a style=\"color:#01a4c6\" href=\"https://r.mail.markuphero.com/tr/mr/e4w_noehGPDho2W-_IgK2sRq5CtBlbaQ-cq0niclRgwrobO2C83zaEKg6jBPewD4eezWVusK1HFoEQYFFSXUPljC21gs8OlrfWYp2T4m5foHiflUzXe6Ddq69TCDZkwDH0P0ny3DstF4lsCQci2y2F8e5sf9wQ1I7S1VoV1oK2zJHU0Vl1T6\" target=\"_blank\">here</a></div><div>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<span style=\"font-size:14px\">Hi  Matt, </span></p>\n\t<p>\n\t\t<span style=\"font-size:14px\">Have you tried crop? It&#39;s really useful, but it&#39;s only available for Superhero accounts.</span></p>\n</div>\n<p>\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14px\"><img alt=\"Crop &amp; Resize Canvas\" src=\"https://img.mail.markuphero.com/im/2869109/9a9e0fbd30a6f863d09e6e20a4bc8a0a908586bdc1208169e311b540d44782e1.png?e=Hs_9rxTu5dJn0oDHFQ5IzZBbmX9AvS2VQC4aYyXNXh4pANT4dc1aslTAUr3dPIjyd-GYiM_oanSDqTcHHWDYtlPbQ56RFyQXXbVzw-S5W3SE73ioM4JkFFmiXf8UeJnhuCVLQbndGx4cSLy1wMdm77hzsVJKi3JRAwGzSxeg12g-S5AsB46ZoxRepAp4ZlU-Xy6GSpgelNfgVaDK-7ctmooZqJFH6xuoUVnHy57EAQQVZT-LeU9z9iIj6m08AbsgKg\" width=\"450\"></span></p>\n<p>\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14px\">Start using crop and much more by upgrading to Superhero. Try it out for <strong>FREE</strong> using this <a href=\"https://r.mail.markuphero.com/tr/cl/ZE5FVWdK79uFmijZPuWxHdKgV12ID-ftTszXiwE4kIDUtLbUZJ3p8i1c-WjcYPQaHE_PNzU902hqsiaDwHjVYy4qpkeu-riHv2P-Ix6ZK3KYLMdb1QAYB3iQiN_6Qr9kaBu1DcwMmcrPsUbryS8hwYBvw2McUbCujTgKOklLdPq4AJ6CDRnxCq5Ln_lkEheoVbl7Pq5oUY5Vhr8tiQGdPTq-C_STiIEVyXA8uifSEgkiTl5xeuwbXrWiAZlt05k\" target=\"_blank\">coupon</a> code.</span></p>\n<p>\n\t<br>\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14px\">Happy annotating!</span><br>\n\t </p>\n<p>\n\t<strong style=\"font-size:14px\">Jeff and Team @ Markup Hero</strong><br>\n\t </p>\n<p>\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14px\">PS: For some handy tips, check out our <strong><a href=\"https://r.mail.markuphero.com/tr/cl/B6d5feR4G3oSbdDDNo6C0pMx51LqEYYPM0uicmQPxKOMT1WbpnY-pVoqSFQk2V6nUPFB4QnNFQ8cRa7ba2SVirq2HlylPH6SGxBUrYozPtORB2whlhdeGE6UnF5nWkLcmE9gmtuAAE47wADI1mErIi_IJugXswE_N8fj19Sm2WfSW6kj3aA9IfKkF71EVHmDQY9LjAS8e1BqvEYq9jSGfvSYGuyNdBDql2qaCEju0VL-Dm0IKw2Ye14df3Oi-EE\" target=\"_blank\">Use Cases and How To&#39;s</a></strong>.</span></p>\n<hr>\n<p>\n\t<span style=\"font-size:14px\">If you need any help or want to share feedback, please use the chat bubble on the bottom of our site <a href=\"https://r.mail.markuphero.com/tr/cl/uzGYCy-uwmsMPxlbpWT2QRXyX0IWbI-oZS4PO9HwGlwJYdJJ6L2GYlken8I9vkN2OL0l-zBRo3JoHi1DMimDOKULbGgPGkEYcxXjyzRzCWNxQyrevzR6r0VWdNErCbP-y7sJWR5-T-S68ukcCuoSYo6M6l9M5oqRyfPAx436kr_L2QFjIHYOsgRMwGohZd0_zaGEXBdPp2zQFUusGDEn-z4\" target=\"_blank\">https://markuphero.com</a>.</span></p>\n<p>\n\t<span style=\"font-size:12px\">Hearing from us not your cup of tea? <a href=\"https://r.mail.markuphero.com/tr/un/j-tuzqurc-IkZU91kXYbkL2vEsZbsW7o_xJJkU480E-oowlWEkKVdRvN2qRXo07lKcypxDxFXvvom-mqLKUsEkz_d-Y5DQxol7yVx4FFlD84rKEEBxNrgD7kskDGTfNDYvirjSQHjXJJwNf_FoBUaQhTDk1Gv8-zkvYo-jX0AB4RDGVhKBokPEiR0a4Dw9R0QUFh0aYxYWi_m4d62l_poRXl9W3-8FkEHg\" target=\"_blank\">Unsubscribe</a></span></p>\n<img width=\"1\" height=\"1\" src=\"https://r.mail.markuphero.com/tr/op/y1vlgRiK8LvsJA1U1siMfi_AemuCE1XcbD7kIewpsmuYKjj9Clnjx_l9_5ISBW4pBLlmwys4V-4R8q_qFsa_dVBIonCoC8DKykjmpSRIjk73SltNQmjJhf1kzMJ_RNeZ8K_Q1fcujjX2Kh8M40SMuYX1Og0xwQ2e5zxZ\" alt=\"\"></div>\n\n</div></div>\n",
