  "text": "---------- Forwarded message ---------\nFrom: Jeff Solomon <jeff@markuphero.com>\nDate: Thu, Jul 21, 2022 at 10:32 PM\nSubject: Crop, it's so useful 🧐\nTo: <matt@hellodeco.so>\n\n\nIf you are not able to see this mail, click here\n<https://r.mail.markuphero.com/tr/mr/e4w_noehGPDho2W-_IgK2sRq5CtBlbaQ-cq0niclRgwrobO2C83zaEKg6jBPewD4eezWVusK1HFoEQYFFSXUPljC21gs8OlrfWYp2T4m5foHiflUzXe6Ddq69TCDZkwDH0P0ny3DstF4lsCQci2y2F8e5sf9wQ1I7S1VoV1oK2zJHU0Vl1T6>\n\nHi Matt,\n\nHave you tried crop? It's really useful, but it's only available for\nSuperhero accounts.\n\n[image: Crop & Resize Canvas]\n\nStart using crop and much more by upgrading to Superhero. Try it out for\n*FREE* using this coupon\n<https://r.mail.markuphero.com/tr/cl/ZE5FVWdK79uFmijZPuWxHdKgV12ID-ftTszXiwE4kIDUtLbUZJ3p8i1c-WjcYPQaHE_PNzU902hqsiaDwHjVYy4qpkeu-riHv2P-Ix6ZK3KYLMdb1QAYB3iQiN_6Qr9kaBu1DcwMmcrPsUbryS8hwYBvw2McUbCujTgKOklLdPq4AJ6CDRnxCq5Ln_lkEheoVbl7Pq5oUY5Vhr8tiQGdPTq-C_STiIEVyXA8uifSEgkiTl5xeuwbXrWiAZlt05k>\ncode.\n\n\nHappy annotating!\n\n\n*Jeff and Team @ Markup Hero*\n\n\nPS: For some handy tips, check out our *Use Cases and How To's\n<https://r.mail.markuphero.com/tr/cl/B6d5feR4G3oSbdDDNo6C0pMx51LqEYYPM0uicmQPxKOMT1WbpnY-pVoqSFQk2V6nUPFB4QnNFQ8cRa7ba2SVirq2HlylPH6SGxBUrYozPtORB2whlhdeGE6UnF5nWkLcmE9gmtuAAE47wADI1mErIi_IJugXswE_N8fj19Sm2WfSW6kj3aA9IfKkF71EVHmDQY9LjAS8e1BqvEYq9jSGfvSYGuyNdBDql2qaCEju0VL-Dm0IKw2Ye14df3Oi-EE>*\n.\n------------------------------\n\nIf you need any help or want to share feedback, please use the chat bubble\non the bottom of our site https://markuphero.com\n<https://r.mail.markuphero.com/tr/cl/uzGYCy-uwmsMPxlbpWT2QRXyX0IWbI-oZS4PO9HwGlwJYdJJ6L2GYlken8I9vkN2OL0l-zBRo3JoHi1DMimDOKULbGgPGkEYcxXjyzRzCWNxQyrevzR6r0VWdNErCbP-y7sJWR5-T-S68ukcCuoSYo6M6l9M5oqRyfPAx436kr_L2QFjIHYOsgRMwGohZd0_zaGEXBdPp2zQFUusGDEn-z4>\n.\n\nHearing from us not your cup of tea? Unsubscribe\n<https://r.mail.markuphero.com/tr/un/j-tuzqurc-IkZU91kXYbkL2vEsZbsW7o_xJJkU480E-oowlWEkKVdRvN2qRXo07l